    "source_note": "Florida Department of Law Enforcement (FDLE), Criminal Justice Standards and Training Commission. The PDF itself is dated September 2, 2025 — about a year old as of this import; re-check before relying on it for anything time-sensitive.",
    "verified": "2026-08-06",
    "caveat": "This is the SHERIFF'S OWN listed email, not necessarily a dedicated records/FOIA custodian address. It is the office's one official published contact, same trust level as soe_email, but a records request sent there may still get forwarded internally before it reaches whoever actually processes it.",
    "naming_note": "Three offices publish under a name that doesn't literally include \"County\" (Miami-Dade, Pasco, Volusia), and Duval County's is legally the \"Jacksonville Sheriff's Office\" due to consolidated city-county government — mapped back to county names here."
  },
